This ontology fragment represents the classes `GRES`, `Shard`, and `Gpu`, as well as the properties `hasGres`, `GresTypes`, and `AccountingStorageTRES`. The properties have the appropriate domain and range declarations. The `GRES` class is a superclass for `Shard` and `Gpu`. The `GresTypes` and `AccountingStorageTRES` properties are expected to return lists of `GRES` instances.

